      "observation": "全文CombatRoll tryRolling/RollManager/ClientPlayerEntityMixin/ServerNetwork/NeoForge与Fabric接收/LivingEntityInvulnerable/ClientNetwork：冷却charges与属性充值都在LocalPlayer manager，每roll先减charge清timeSince再发C2S；server先给tracking发送animation再executeIfPossible赋invulnerableTicks/exhaust/stat/event，忽略包playerId用实际sender但未复核charge/冷却/食物/地面/维度代际。无敌在Living.tick TAIL递减，hurtServer HEAD当>0直接false；重复包重置窗口并重播。S2C enqueue后按当前world数字ID找玩家无UUID/TTL。实际客户端预算与服务器短保护窗口跨阶段消费整条一计，不把独立平台包装/packet/属性注册再算。",
